# Visuel Concept modules (@visuelconcept-winccoa/wui-*) are private packages on GitHub Packages.
# No token here — this file is committed. Each developer authenticates once, in ~/.npmrc:
#   npm config set "//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken" <token with read:packages>
# (gh auth token after `gh auth refresh -s read:packages`, or a classic PAT — fine-grained tokens are refused).
@visuelconcept-winccoa:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
